				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13775430/the-hills-of-adelanto-are-covered-in-a-cinnabar-green#post-4786063</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2020 11:44:42 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Sebarus</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2341265</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Third instalment in Spectrum! This was a collaboration between myself and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncertaintycrossing" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4257427&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1601552682" alt="UncertaintyCrossing" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4257427)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncertaintycrossing" >UncertaintyCrossing</a></span>. We were a little pressed for time, but I'm happy with the result. Especially my collaborators part.</p> <p>Adelanto in real life is an interesting town. It was founded by the inventor of the hot iron, and it used to make most of its money through fruit imports. Nowadays its biggest moneymakers are its prisons, and weed, apparently. Thus the vegetation.</p> 
				 	]]>
